## Third-Party Models

The weapon detection model used in this project is based on the
“Weapons and Knives Detection Using YOLOv8” repository by JoaoAssalim:

- GitHub: https://github.com/JoaoAssalim/Weapons-and-Knives-Detector-with-YOLOv8  
- License: GPL-3.0 :contentReference[oaicite:3]{index=3}

This credit acknowledges the original work and specifies its license.

